    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "API integration with the existing hospital information system (SIH) and the electronic patient record (DPI) is FULLY COVERED through standard connectors and custom adapters where needed." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Support for health interoperability standards (HL7 / FHIR), the national health identifier (INS), and the national framework (Ségur du numérique en santé, Mon espace santé / DMP) is FULLY COVERED with production support for main resources and extended resource coverage on the roadmap, along with INS support and framework alignment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with user directories is FULLY COVERED through SSO options like SAML and OIDC, as well as LDAP and Entra ID user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting on SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure or equivalent is FULLY COVERED with the Sovereign HDS tier provided by OuraneCloud. the proposed architecture would utilize our Atelier platform, hosted on the Sovereign HDS tier provided by OuraneCloud to meet security, sovereignty, and performance requirements. the proposed architecture includes integration with SIH and DPI via API, support for HL7 and FHIR standards, INS, and national health frameworks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "User directory integration will be achieved through SSO and existing user directory protocols." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Atelier platform's components such as the document-ingestion pipeline, vector store, retrieval layer, orchestration layer, and answer layer will work together to provide the required response times and availability targets." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict compliance with GDPR, health data protection as special-category data (GDPR Art. 9), medical confidentiality preservation, exclusive hosting within the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union, sensitive data protection through encryption and pseudonymisation where relevant, Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification for infrastructure, explainability and traceability of recommendations or suggestions produced by the solution, and positioning as an assistance tool without automating clinical or medico-administrative decisions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security measures should we implement to ensure compliance with these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with these requirements, we should leverage we existing certifications and data protection measures. we ISO 27001 certification, which includes the privacy information management extension through ISO 27701, already covers the development, delivery, and operations of we services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we HDS certification for health-data hosting through OuraneCloud ensures compliance with health data protection standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For encryption and pseudonymisation, we should utilize we existing TLS 1.3 for encryption in transit and AES-256 for encryption at rest, alongside we pseudonymisation capabilities to protect sensitive data. we key management infrastructure, being the European Union-based, also aligns with the requirement for hosting within the European Union." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To maintain strict isolation and segregation of duties, we will enforce tenant isolation between client corpora, utilizing per-engagement logical separation, Role-Based Access Control (RBAC), and audit logging for all access and system outputs. we Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointment and maintenance of a data processing register further demonstrate we commitment to GDPR compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For explainability and traceability, we product Atelier is designed to provide grounded sources, retrieval traces, and an audit log, supporting a posteriori review and medical confidentiality preservation. designed positions we well to meet the requirements for explainability and traceability of recommendations or suggestions produced by the solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By emphasizing that our product Atelier is an assistance platform rather than an automation tool for clinical or medico-administrative decisions, we align with The tender requirement for positioning as a support tool without automating decision-making processes.  we should also ensure that all data remains within the European Union, leveraging OuraneCloud SecNumCloud qualification to guarantee sovereign cloud hosting that meets the specified requirements. we vulnerability management and incident response plans will be crucial in maintaining the security and integrity of we services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, adherence to GDPR Art. 28 through we Data Processing Agreement (DPA) ensures that we data processing practices are compliant with GDPR Art. 28 requirements for processors." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By implementing the regulation's requirements for processors, we can ensure strict compliance with The tender requirements regarding GDPR, health data protection, encryption, pseudonymisation, HDS certification, explainability, traceability, and the positioning of our product Atelier as an assistance tool." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires compliance with GDPR, medical confidentiality preservation, no transfer of data outside the EU, Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification, and explainability and traceability of AI outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must not require medical-device qualification (CE marking / MDR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with these regulatory obligations? we have experience with GDPR compliance, including Article 9 special-category data and Article 28 processing agreements, as well as medical confidentiality preservation, which are monitored by we Security & Compliance function. we also comply with Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS), ensuring that health data is handled in accordance with French regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding data transfer, we do not have information on whether we operations involve transferring data outside the EU, but we client data ownership policy states that the client retains full ownership of the client own documents and produced data, which may mitigate some risks associated with data transfer. we AI models, including the sovereign European open-weight model used under the sovereign European open-weight model used under its open-weight licence open-weight licence and proprietary third-party models accessed under commercial licences, are deployed in a health context, and we monitor the EU AI Act requirements for such systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we compliance with explainability and traceability of AI outputs is not explicitly stated, which could be a potential risk." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for medical-device qualification, we Legal function flags CE/MDR implications when a use case approaches the medical-device threshold, and we aim to ensure that we solutions do not require such qualification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, provided that we solution does not trigger medical-device thresholds, we appear to be largely compliant with the specified regulatory obligations, but we should flag potential risks related to data transfer outside the EU and ensure that we AI outputs meet explainability and traceability requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client's global budget is 900,000 over 5 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Annual operating costs must remain controlled and compatible with the authority's budgetary capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires a pilot phase followed by progressive rollout." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on The tender, and are there cost-optimisation strategies our can propose? our target gross margin percentage ranges from 25% to 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering The client's global budget of €900,000 over 5 years, our can estimate the potential revenue." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without knowing the exact breakdown of services and resources required for a pilot phase followed by progressive rollout, it's difficult to provide an exact projected margin." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "That being said, assuming our can maintain our standard daily rates and considering the cost structure, which includes one-off project costs and recurring run costs, our should aim to optimize costs to achieve a gross margin within our target range." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Generated content must be adapted to the clinical/administrative context and conform to expected quality standards. 3.3 Dossier-handling assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Cost-optimization strategies our can propose include choosing a more cost-efficient hosting tier, such as the sovereign HDS tier, and selecting a cost-effective model option, like the sovereign European model." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "These choices can help reduce recurring costs, particularly hosting and inference costs, which are identified as main recurring cost drivers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By doing so, our can maintain a controlled annual operating cost while preserving an acceptable margin. our finance role will work closely with the architect to ensure the proposed configuration stays within the authority's budget envelope." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects an intelligent assistance tool for hospital staff, capable of supporting clinical-administrative activities such as information retrieval, drafting medical and administrative documents, handling dossiers, and facilitating continuity of care." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must provide explainable recommendations or suggestions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and innovation strategies can we propose to meet these expectations? we can propose we AI & Innovation capabilities centered around Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) to support clinical-administrative activities for hospital staff. we core approach allows for grounded answers that cite passages from the client's controlled corpus, ensuring explainability and limiting unsupported generation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Key components include hybrid retrieval, re-ranking, query reformulation, multi-document synthesis, structured extraction, template-guided drafting, applicable rules recall, action and verification suggestions, and dossier-context continuity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Key components can be leveraged to provide intelligent assistance with information retrieval, medical and administrative document drafting, dossier handling, and care continuity. we iterative approach involves corpus selection and curation with client experts, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design per use case, and an evaluation loop to ensure high-quality outcomes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Explainability features such as source citations, retrieved passages, retrieval trace, and interaction logging will provide transparency into the decision-making process. we can also offer model options that trade performance against explainability and sovereignty, with either a sovereign European open-weight model or top-tier proprietary models via API, selected based on the client's specific needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By embedding we assistant into existing workflows and tools, we can augment clinical and administrative processes without introducing disruption, ultimately reducing processing and documentation times while enhancing care continuity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist staff in analysing and handling dossiers by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The client information systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The titleholder must propose a solution that contributes to reducing energy consumption and relies, as far as possible, on low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we ensure a solution that contributes to reducing energy consumption and relies, as far as possible, on low-carbon infrastructure aligns with these sustainability goals? we can ensure a solution that contributes to reducing energy consumption and relies, as far as possible, on low-carbon infrastructure aligns with The client sustainability goals by leveraging we green hosting partner, OuraneCloud, which offers sovereign hosting in the EU region, utilizes renewable energy, and has a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we can implement digital sobriety practices such as model right-sizing, caching, and batching to reduce energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By utilizing we carbon reporting capability, we can also provide transparency on the environmental footprint of a solution that contributes to reducing energy consumption and relies, as far as possible, on low-carbon infrastructure, allowing the client to make informed decisions about the client information systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, we published trajectory to reduce carbon intensity per managed assistant year on year demonstrates we commitment to continually improving the sustainability of we solutions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) can leverage The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Atelier platform, hosted on the Sovereign HDS tier of OuraneCloud, to meet the security, sovereignty, and performance requirements of The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) artificial intelligence solution for hospital staff." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This setup includes integration with the existing hospital information system (SIH) and the electronic patient record (DPI) via API, support for HL7 and FHIR standards, INS, and national health frameworks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "User directory integration will be achieved through SSO and existing user directory protocols. our Atelier platform, hosted on the Sovereign HDS tier of OuraneCloud, provides response times below 2 seconds for common queries at p95, with an active-active setup across two availability zones and a stated availability target of 99.9%, ensuring continuity of care outside office hours (24/7 services). our Atelier platform, hosted on the Sovereign HDS tier of OuraneCloud, components work together to provide the required response times and availability targets." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with regulatory requirements, The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) leverage The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) existing certifications and data protection measures, including ISO 27001 certification, which includes the privacy information management extension through ISO 27701, and HDS certification for health-data hosting through OuraneCloud." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must support medical coding (PMSI / ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk150> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) utilize TLS 1.3 for encryption in transit and AES-256 for encryption at rest, alongside pseudonymisation capabilities to protect sensitive data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) key management infrastructure is EU-based, aligning with the requirement for hosting within EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk152> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) enforce tenant isolation between client corpora, utilizing per-engagement logical separation, Role-Based Access Control (RBAC), and audit logging for all access and system outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk153> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointment and maintenance of a data processing register demonstrate The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) commitment to GDPR compliance. our Atelier platform, hosted on the Sovereign HDS tier of OuraneCloud, is designed to provide grounded sources, retrieval traces, and an audit log, supporting a posteriori review and medical confidentiality preservation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk154> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) solution is positioned as an assistance tool rather than an automation tool for clinical or medico-administrative decisions, aligning with the tender's requirement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk155> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) ensure that all data remains within EU, leveraging OuraneCloud SecNumCloud qualification to guarantee sovereign cloud hosting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk156> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Adherence to GDPR Art. 28 through The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Data Processing Agreement (DPA) ensures that The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) data processing practices are compliant with GDPR Art. 28 requirements for processors." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk157> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) propose The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) AI & Innovation capabilities centered around Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) to support clinical-administrative activities for hospital staff." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk158> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) core approach allows for grounded answers that cite passages from the client's controlled corpus, ensuring explainability and limiting unsupported generation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk159> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Key components include hybrid retrieval, re-ranking, query reformulation, multi-document synthesis, structured extraction, template-guided drafting, applicable rules recall, action and verification suggestions, and dossier-context continuity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk16> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must take the dossier context into account where available." ;
