    <http://example.org/node/chunk160> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) iterative approach involves corpus selection and curation with client experts, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design per use case, and an evaluation loop to ensure high-quality outcomes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk161> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Explainability features such as source citations, retrieved passages, retrieval trace, and interaction logging provide transparency into the decision-making process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk162> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) offer model options that trade performance against explainability and sovereignty, with either a sovereign European open-weight model or top-tier proprietary models via API." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk163> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs while guaranteeing the expected quality of service, The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) aim to maintain The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) standard daily rates and consider the cost structure, which includes one-off project costs and recurring run costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk164> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Cost-optimization strategies include choosing a more cost-efficient hosting tier, such as the sovereign HDS tier, and selecting a cost-effective model option, like a sovereign European open-weight model." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk165> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Finally, The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) align with the client's sustainability goals by leveraging OuraneCloud green hosting in the EU region, utilizing renewable energy, and having a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2." ;
